(19)
?Regulation" means a regulation made under section 47 of this Act;
(20)
?Research?? means any activity connected to agriculture/horticulture for improving crop productivity;
(21)
?Rules" means rules made under section 46 of this Act;
(22)
?Schedule? means Schedule appended to this Act;
(23)
?Secretary" means a person appointed by the Executive Committee under section 14;
(24)
?Standing Committee" means the Committee appointed by the Executive Committee conferring certain responsibilities
to be carried out on behalf of the Council;
(25)
?Teaching" means imparting knowledge to the concerned persons in the field of Agriculture/ Horticulture;
